* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB4 IBUF VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net0 1p
M1 VX net2 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
